{"2825730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nekokami: Internship - The Prologue Adventure", "steam_appid": 2825730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/10159be67912e39fae5842dfa5442deb.avif?t=1787014320\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras_big/10159be67912e39fae5842dfa5442deb.webp?t=1787014320 width=1560 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thanks to everyone who supported our prologue, the full version of <i>Nekokami - The Human Restoration Project</i> has finally been released!🎉 With your invaluable feedback we have made significant improvement to gameplay and graphics - check it out at our developer page or scroll down to &quot;More from Rocket-in-Bottle&quot;! 🚀</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/5f9a94ee3be8f395a138a002400291f9.poster.avif?t=1787014320\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/5f9a94ee3be8f395a138a002400291f9.webm?t=1787014320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/5f9a94ee3be8f395a138a002400291f9.mp4?t=1787014320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Screenshot from full version.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/db8669d366cb6a3c0ca52b9abb215e0c.avif?t=1787014320\" width=1560 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ <u>Nekokami: Internship is a prologue to the full game Nekokami. Created as a prototype in 2023, this free prologue contains 20+ Expeditions and roughly 4 hours of story-rich gameplay.</u> 🐣</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/5778ad38a16bd1e0bacdeaef246a7579.poster.avif?t=1787014320\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/5778ad38a16bd1e0bacdeaef246a7579.webm?t=1787014320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/5778ad38a16bd1e0bacdeaef246a7579.mp4?t=1787014320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/f78d1cfa558dfd91547a35dadc5a2c0f.avif?t=1787014320\" width=616 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this sneak peek of the full game, you will:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌏 Create beautiful worlds of natural habitats and human settlements with strategic, or spontaneous, placement of tiles in a unique hand-drawn-like art style. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌌 Follow the beginning of a whimsical yet heart-warming story of Human-Cat friendship, set millennia later in the future. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💼 Earn your place in Nekokami Co., your employer, by creating worlds that beat expectations. Or just relax. Your bosses are Cats after all. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔮 Befriend a selection of Kami, spirits of the nature and the universe, and see them bring miracles to your work. They are Cats too. What could go wrong?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/4ef0c006337f014e9463e526c49c92bc.avif?t=1787014320\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌟 Nekokami Co. is commissioned to manage planets all over the universe. That's a LOT of planets! Environment, biomes and rules differ from Star System to Star System. You will get to visit at least SIX Star Systems during your internship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐈 I did mention the Kami*, right? Technically the spirits are the real fellows creating the worlds. As a Planetary Architect, you are basically borrowing their Creative Energy for your own use. You will need to seek their acceptance and approval. Through their friendship, you will potentially learn the secrets of nature and the arcane laws of universe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/0d7be0eb0198e4dd9614f4a79706b0c3.poster.avif?t=1787014320\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/0d7be0eb0198e4dd9614f4a79706b0c3.webm?t=1787014320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/0d7be0eb0198e4dd9614f4a79706b0c3.mp4?t=1787014320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Kami is actually a Japanese word that roughly translates to &quot;spirits and gods&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This game was made by a tiny tiny independent game studio in Fukuoka. We hope you enjoy it!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/10159be67912e39fae5842dfa5442deb.avif?t=1787014320\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras_big/10159be67912e39fae5842dfa5442deb.webp?t=1787014320 width=1560 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thanks to everyone who supported our prologue, the full version of <i>Nekokami - The Human Restoration Project</i> has finally been released!🎉 With your invaluable feedback we have made significant improvement to gameplay and graphics - check it out at our developer page or scroll down to &quot;More from Rocket-in-Bottle&quot;! 🚀</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/5f9a94ee3be8f395a138a002400291f9.poster.avif?t=1787014320\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/5f9a94ee3be8f395a138a002400291f9.webm?t=1787014320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/5f9a94ee3be8f395a138a002400291f9.mp4?t=1787014320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>(Screenshot from full version.)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/db8669d366cb6a3c0ca52b9abb215e0c.avif?t=1787014320\" width=1560 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ <u>Nekokami: Internship is a prologue to the full game Nekokami. Created as a prototype in 2023, this free prologue contains 20+ Expeditions and roughly 4 hours of story-rich gameplay.</u> 🐣</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/5778ad38a16bd1e0bacdeaef246a7579.poster.avif?t=1787014320\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/5778ad38a16bd1e0bacdeaef246a7579.webm?t=1787014320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/5778ad38a16bd1e0bacdeaef246a7579.mp4?t=1787014320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/f78d1cfa558dfd91547a35dadc5a2c0f.avif?t=1787014320\" width=616 height=170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this sneak peek of the full game, you will:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌏 Create beautiful worlds of natural habitats and human settlements with strategic, or spontaneous, placement of tiles in a unique hand-drawn-like art style. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌌 Follow the beginning of a whimsical yet heart-warming story of Human-Cat friendship, set millennia later in the future. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💼 Earn your place in Nekokami Co., your employer, by creating worlds that beat expectations. Or just relax. Your bosses are Cats after all. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔮 Befriend a selection of Kami, spirits of the nature and the universe, and see them bring miracles to your work. They are Cats too. What could go wrong?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/4ef0c006337f014e9463e526c49c92bc.avif?t=1787014320\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌟 Nekokami Co. is commissioned to manage planets all over the universe. That's a LOT of planets! Environment, biomes and rules differ from Star System to Star System. You will get to visit at least SIX Star Systems during your internship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐈 I did mention the Kami*, right? Technically the spirits are the real fellows creating the worlds. As a Planetary Architect, you are basically borrowing their Creative Energy for your own use. You will need to seek their acceptance and approval. Through their friendship, you will potentially learn the secrets of nature and the arcane laws of universe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/0d7be0eb0198e4dd9614f4a79706b0c3.poster.avif?t=1787014320\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/0d7be0eb0198e4dd9614f4a79706b0c3.webm?t=1787014320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/extras/0d7be0eb0198e4dd9614f4a79706b0c3.mp4?t=1787014320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Kami is actually a Japanese word that roughly translates to &quot;spirits and gods&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This game was made by a tiny tiny independent game studio in Fukuoka. We hope you enjoy it!</p>", "short_description": "Architect beautiful, peaceful worlds in a far-future where Cats rule the universe. Befriend sometimes-naughty spirits of nature. Manage Humans. Join us in this unique planet-building adventure and get a taste of the full journey!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese", "reviews": "“Nekokami looks like it'll be intriguing for fans of tile-placing games like Dorfromantik, though with a more objective focused set of challenges and puzzles rather than open-ended score chasing.”<br>PC Gamer<br><br>“(Translated) I felt that even the early tutorial-like stages had a sufficient amount of content, but there are still plenty of stages to play and enjoy!”<br>Indie Freaks<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/header.jpg?t=1787014320", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/f0a6264f5e66646acc94fd46a3e501dd92e469b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787014320", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825730/f0a6264f5e66646acc94fd46a3e501dd92e469b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787014320", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5 GHz Dual Core (Intel / AMD)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><